      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Practice: 30-Day Log</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0b0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Your Personal Evidence</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Day</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Bed</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Wake</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Total</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Quality</text><text x=\"660\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Energy</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Mood</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Notes</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"230\" width=\"940\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"260\" width=\"940\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">7</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"290\" width=\"940\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">14</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"320\" width=\"940\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">21</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"350\" width=\"940\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">30</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"400\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"445\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Day 30 Analysis</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Calculate averages:</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">• Average sleep time</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"560\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">• Average quality, energy, mood</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Identify patterns:</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"635\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">• Best 3 nights — what conditions?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"660\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ec4899\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ec4899\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Worst 3 Nights Analysis</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"750\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">• What did they have in common?</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">• Late caffeine? Alcohol? Stress? Late screens?</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"820\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffd700\">• Now you know your personal saboteurs.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Your data are more persuasive than any book.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "30 days of data tells your story."
