     "type": "quote",
     "title": "Capstone Synthesis: Your Sleep Future",
     "content": "\"Sleep is the elixir of life. It is the foundation of physical, mental, and emotional well-being. The shorter your sleep, the shorter your life — but the converse is equally true. Better sleep, better life.\" — Matthew Walker\n\nYou now have: the science (Lessons 1-7), the recognition of disorders (Lesson 8), and a practical protocol (Lesson 9). Implement gradually. Measure honestly. Adjust based on data. Respect the biology. Walker's final word: 'Tonight matters.'",
